[{"title":"和韩听颖师琴","author":"王十朋","text":"七弦自相语，唱予仍和汝。\n千指忽凄凉，骚人悲战场。\n大弦温和小消越，惠风夷韵参悠扬。\n琴瑟鸣寒泉，仪仪舞鸾凰。\n山高水远听愈淡，花奴羯鼓声方彊。\n施生幽雅士，不好笙与篁。\n千金买焦尾，悠然坐藜床。\n顾我非知音，感激涕自滂。\n三听辄三叹，羲皇在我齑盐肠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17336,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和韩忆昨行示梦龄","author":"王十朋","text":"忆昨少年气锐心未灰，平明出门薄暮回。\n解衣换酒期必醉，乱花压面攲条枚。\n年华荏苒今半世，触事往往生悲哀。\n欢娱无复少年味，勉强谈笑陪尊罍。\n饮才过量辄成疾，秋霜入鬓刚肠摧。\n子年少我气鼎盛，琅玕夜诵声如雷。\n匈中平时足蕴藉，颐神养素成婴孩。\n松姿柏质异蒲柳，坚刚不怕霜霰漼。\n凌云变化未可料，岂比嵲屼风中桅。\n胡为郁郁乃如许，与我老者同虺隤。\n岂缘心事未如愿，一念遂觉忧愁来。\n还惊世态多险阻，忤意未兑生嫌猜。\n壮怀千里力未致，龃龉翻类三足能。\n伤和伐性致坎轲，两眉蹙恨凭谁开。\n吾闻君子贵知命，数者于我何有哉。\n又闻古人亦迍蹇，在易固有无妄灾。\n闭门静坐养时晦，拂拭心镜捐尘埃。\n他年定作仁者寿，齿背会见同鲵鲐。\n圣贤遗训载子腹，此事宁不知所裁。\n否往泰来固有日，坦涂利毂宁须推。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17337,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和韩燕河南府秀才送周光宗","author":"王十朋","text":"吾皇尚柔理，北客来输平。\n投戈讲文艺，虞庠萃群英。\n蔼蔼六年间，人物如西京。\n菁莪各成材，龙虎巍标名。\n东嘉号多士，半作鸿都生。\n昭然藻鉴中，不负事业精。\n先进日通显，天衢作雷轰。\n后生益可畏，行艺方蜚声。\n贤哉汝南丈，头角令人惊。\n撑肠饱文史，欲振三年鸣。\n偃蹇未如志，造物殊无情。\n归来务遵养，绝意蜗角争。\n高堂有慈亲，禄养须大烹。\n壮怀不能已，千里提短檠。\n掉头脱尘鞅，举翼摩太清。\n贱子忝交末，平生荷推诚。\n缅怀去年春，驾言共西征。\n悠悠旧时路，君今独先行。\n江梅弄春色，爱日烘新晴。\n勿惮行役苦，会见归来荣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17338,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和韩答张辙寄曹梦良","author":"王十朋","text":"故旧别云久，话言犹未聆。\n岁暮念愈剧，宵长梦形频。\n忆昔始倾盖，相看俱妙龄。\n参乎方越席，鲤也才趋庭。\n乐泮共采藻，泛江同食萍。\n玄深探羲画，狂妄窥麟经。\n端能辨箕荄，未省分雷霆。\n卷帙发晨架，膏油燃夜棂。\n君才富八斗，我字识一丁。\n轻愿苦窘幅，高屋钦建瓴。\n低头愿为愈，割席终惭宁。\n结游指寥廓，约泛航清泠。\n骥足骋天骏，鳌头缗海腥。\n涂远困尘鞅，棹回阁寒汀。\n壮怀誓白水，愤气干青冥。\n孤屿散形影，双溪隔沧溟。\n耿耿月遥共，悠悠门独扃。\n论文忆李白，对酒怀刘伶。\n乡校鼓沂瑟，颂章赓鲁駉。\n濯暑振风袂，破寒操雪舲。\n胜游仿栗里，雅会脩兰亭。\n瓶罄沽瓮蚁，烛残照囊萤。\n猖狂却大雅，酩酊还独醒。\n槐市忽飞诏，英才先振翎。\n短檠歌慷慨，长剑磨晶荧。\n旧耻雪赤壁，奇功收井陉。\n高价压群玉，新文丽繁星。\n乡闾借光艳，庠序资仪刑。\n随群袍暂白，唾手衫当青。\n残生适孤苦，举足方伶俜。\n文房泣遗泽，座右悲先铭。\n犬马不填壑，凫鹥卒同泾。\n射缟服彊箭，撞钟施寸筳。\n惟求免场屋，讵望扬王庭。\n师旋约奏凯，案就期脱囹。\n势屈战徒力，命奇文不灵。\n秋翼困燕雀，春苗害蟊螟。\n日念返桑梓，愿言和鸾铃。\n溪山有偕隐，风雨无独听。\n悬崖踏苍翠，怪石穿珑玲。\n豹闲眠雾窟，鸟倦栖云屏。\n世情自翻覆，交态长芳馨。\n岁时觉荏苒，咫尺如飘零。\n盈亏屡瞻桂，开落频观蓂。\n欲去废负米，念来方祝蛉。\n何时掺子手，一笑空吾瓶。\n注目杳云雁，缄书附原鸰。\n鄙吝伫涤胃，钝顽资发铏。\n得得戒徒驭，迟迟趋阙廷。\n犹胜炙手辈，奔走趋公厅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17339,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"己巳元日读韩送杨郎中贺正诗因和其韵","author":"王十朋","text":"晓日五更鸡咿喔，银缸明灭烧馀脂。\n家家呼牛逐耗鬼，牛归谁家鬼何之。\n皇都朝会我无与，西畴春事行及期。\n弟兄成行拜亲老，犹胜去年身未归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17340,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"人日过电山随行有昌黎集因读城南登高诗遂次韵留别孙先觉","author":"王十朋","text":"腊去梅已稀，阳浮柳初弄。\n北斗新转梢，东风渐消冻。\n为人节固佳，顾我身无用。\n命驾访亲交，肩舆劳仆从。\n门阑念久别，灯烛忻此共。\n兴来酒自斟，欢至攲频送。\n提壶劝衔杯，播谷催除葑。\n农耕方迫归，行乐未能纵。\n人生苦离别，俗状嗟倥偬。\n春风桃李花，把盏何时重。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17341,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和韩李花 其一","author":"王十朋","text":"春风入园林，万卉以艳争相夸。\n胡为此仙李，颜色憔悴堪咨嗟。\n棱棱瘦树数点雪，半醒半睡风攲斜。\n枯枝肤剥少生意，况有疥癣相孽芽。\n不如免葵及燕麦，妍媚春色摇纤葩。\n下自成蹊直虚语，谁肯顾盼留香车。\n顾我逢春少行乐，老眼日有文书遮。\n自怜衰飒已如许，那更对此愁人花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17342,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和韩李花 其二","author":"王十朋","text":"皇都二月桃李盛，朱轮翠盖方纷拿。\n东君世情亦太甚，十分春在侯门花。\n试吟怨句问苍昊，一种春工何损加。\n白华秉烛光照夜，此树不属孤寒家。\n造化无言意潜告，我爱万物初无差。\n物情禀受苦自异，奚有厚薄施萌芽。\n劝君勿为花致怨，居易俟命思无邪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17343,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和韩答柳柳州食虾蟆","author":"王十朋","text":"虫鱼千万族，一一异状貌。\n飞潜同一性，巨细何必校。\n彼微水中蛙，四足伛而疱。\n自从科蚪初，生育在泥淖。\n好鸣乃其性，非故欲喧闹。\n蝈氏职洒灰，恐非圣人教。\n吾闻人间世，生死同梦觉。\n杀物伤吾仁，忍听声熚爆。\n况我儒衣冠，弦诵生乡校。\n彼亦呼子曰，有意欲吾效。\n人虫各好生，奚用苦相挠。\n退之惮食蛇，得得释笼罩。\n子厚放鹧鸪，仁心亦稍稍。\n胡为于此虫，未尽忘嗜乐。\n荐祠用枭獍，穿阱诛虎豹。\n古人岂妄杀，去害除不孝。\n愿留兹鼓吹，驻我寒溪棹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17344,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"伏牺 其一","author":"王十朋","text":"太古民淳事简稀，圣人牛首号包羲。\n如今四海皆人面，心似山川更崄巇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17345,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"伏牺 其二","author":"王十朋","text":"六画中含万象殊，洪荒一变遂归儒。\n河图不授包牺氏，民到于今目尚涂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17346,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"神农","author":"王十朋","text":"民食腥膻鸟兽同，那知土谷利无穷。\n后人只祀勾龙弃，谁念艰难起帝功。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17347,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄帝","author":"王十朋","text":"百年功就蜕乾坤，鼎冷湖空迹尚存。\n别有庆源流不尽，皇朝叶叶是神孙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17348,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"唐尧","author":"王十朋","text":"仁德如天帝业隆，四凶不去付重瞳。\n当时黄屋如传子，千古那知楫逊风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17349,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夏禹","author":"王十朋","text":"洪流浩浩浸寰区，民杂蛇龙鸟兽居。\n长叹当时微帝力，苍生今日尽为鱼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17350,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"启","author":"王十朋","text":"尧舜与贤真可法，夏王传子若堪疑。\n讴攲自属吾君子，不是当时禹德哀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17351,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"少康","author":"王十朋","text":"虞仍靡艾共输忠，一旅中兴复禹功。\n较德宜优汉高帝，知音惟有贵乡公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17352,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"桀","author":"王十朋","text":"大禹辛勤造夏邦，子孙何苦事淫荒。\n国亡不悟生平罪，翻悔当时不杀汤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17353,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"成汤","author":"王十朋","text":"大乙兴仁兽网中，鸣条一战遂成功。\n归来犹自怀惭德，事与唐虞已不同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17354,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"高宗","author":"王十朋","text":"须信精诚可动天，高宗一梦得真贤。\n济川不赖良舟楫，安得中兴五千年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17355,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"纣","author":"王十朋","text":"酿酒为池肉作林，深宫长夜恣荒淫。\n何如早散桥仓粟，结取臣民亿万心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17356,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"周文王","author":"王十朋","text":"民疾商辛若寇雠，三分天下二归周。\n文王终世全臣节，不念前时羑里囚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17357,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"武王","author":"王十朋","text":"八百诸侯会孟津，民心天意总归仁。\n须知不食干戈粟，自有登山采蕨人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17358,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"成王","author":"王十朋","text":"姬旦推诚相幼冲，流言交乱出居东。\n谁云王是中才主，一启金縢即悟公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17359,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宣王","author":"王十朋","text":"北伐南征万国臣，中兴周室赖贤人。\n崧高千古英灵在，何独当时降甫申。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17360,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"幽王","author":"王十朋","text":"文武基图未易量，可怜中叶坏幽王。\n神龙流沫生尤物，赫赫宗周一笑亡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17361,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秦始皇","author":"王十朋","text":"鲸吞六国帝人寰，遣使遥寻海上山。\n仙药未来身已死，銮舆空载鲍鱼还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17362,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"二世","author":"王十朋","text":"始皇一怒逐扶苏，天欲亡秦果在胡。\n翻被四方黔首笑，不分鹿马是谁愚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17363,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"汉高帝 其一","author":"王十朋","text":"百战功成汉业新，咸阳置酒问群臣。\n区区高起王陵辈，岂识龙颜善用人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17364,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"汉高帝 其二","author":"王十朋","text":"仗剑崎岖起沛丰，祇将嫚骂驭英雄。\n虽然能用三人杰，已失商山四老翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17365,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"文帝","author":"王十朋","text":"文帝兴王自代来，百金不费亦仁哉。\n后人不务师恭俭，万户千门几露台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17366,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"武帝","author":"王十朋","text":"武帝英雄类始皇，甘心黩武国几亡。\n晚年赖有知人术，解把婴儿付霍光。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17367,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宣帝","author":"王十朋","text":"道杂霸王非美事，治先刑法少仁恩。\n盖杨韩赵犹诛死，谁谓当时狱不冤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17368,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元帝","author":"王十朋","text":"德化欲遵周轨辙，刑名思革汉规模。\n更生疏斥萧生戮，元帝何曾善用儒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17369,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"光武 其一","author":"王十朋","text":"大命由来自有真，子舆徒号汉家亲。\n须知炎祚中兴主，元是南阳谨厚人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17370,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"光武 其二","author":"王十朋","text":"郁郁葱葱瑞气浮，南阳兵起再兴刘。\n将军大敌非常勇，文叔平生本好柔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17371,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"明帝","author":"王十朋","text":"万乘临雍事老更，桥门亿万会诸生。\n永平天子真儒雅，只恨容人度未宏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17372,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"章帝","author":"王十朋","text":"民苦繁苛厌永平，科除惨狱慰群情。\n不穷窦宪欺君罪，翻被宽柔坏典刑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17373,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"魏武帝","author":"王十朋","text":"董吕袁刘电扫空，阿瞒独步骋奸雄。\n岂知权备皆人杰，未肯全将鼎付公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17374,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吴大帝","author":"王十朋","text":"拔刀斫案气如虹，独倚周郎立隽功。\n一战果摧曹孟德，不妨高枕霸江东。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17375,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蜀先主","author":"王十朋","text":"曹公奸黠世无双，玄德雄才肯见容。\n谁把荆州资霸业，一朝云雨起蛟龙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17376,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晋宣帝","author":"王十朋","text":"四朝天子寄安危，寡妇孤儿岂忍欺。\n见说五湖扛鼎日，又胜三马食槽时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17377,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晋武帝","author":"王十朋","text":"早岁膺图帝业光，晚年何事政多荒。\n算来不用平吴好，毕竟吴平速晋亡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17378,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元帝","author":"王十朋","text":"金陵王气为谁钟，五马南浮一化龙。\n四海民心共思晋，江东何事却从容。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17379,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宋武帝","author":"王十朋","text":"宋武英雄世莫加，长驱千里定中华。\n乘机不据金汤险，自剖乾坤作两家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17380,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"齐太祖","author":"王十朋","text":"天厌金刀水德终，一时人望属萧公。\n能论魏武周文事，独有区区谢侍中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17381,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梁武帝","author":"王十朋","text":"不法先王治用儒，拾身倾国事浮屠。\n堪嗟饿病台城日，曾得空王救死无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17382,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"简文帝","author":"王十朋","text":"青丝白马渡江来，宫殿酣酣尽委灰。\n不解开门纳桃棒，空悲明镜不安台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17383,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"陈武帝","author":"王十朋","text":"一旦权臣外召君，已知天帝欲兴陈。\n江淮若道无神物，谁报齐兵至寿春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17384,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"后主","author":"王十朋","text":"临春阁上醉流霞，狎客酣歌兴未涯。\n江左半无陈日月，君臣犹听后庭花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17385,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"魏道武","author":"王十朋","text":"火举南征破弱燕，拓开中土奠山川。\n功成若更能修德，自可延年度厄年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17386,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"北齐神武","author":"王十朋","text":"浮图入海天亡魏，鹦鹉兴谣运启齐。\n邺下兵兴黄蚁死，营中星陨众驴嘶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17387,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"齐后主","author":"王十朋","text":"峨冠食禄鸡开府，摇尾承恩大郡君。\n将士焉能死征战，盍驱尔辈赴三军。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17388,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"周文帝","author":"王十朋","text":"传檄东征贺六浑，亲迎天子入长安。\n剩栽沙苑千株柳，长使齐军破胆寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17389,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"隋文帝","author":"王十朋","text":"孽后邪臣造衅端，房陵幽闭抱深冤。\n一朝变起宫闱内，方信当时用妇言。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17390,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"炀帝","author":"王十朋","text":"汴水东流岸柳春，龙舟南下锦帆新。\n鸟声劝酒梅花笑，笑杀隋亡亦似陈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17391,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"唐太宗","author":"王十朋","text":"仁义谁云不可行，文皇亲见治功成。\n德彝可惜身先死，岂信人间有太平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17392,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"高宗","author":"王十朋","text":"贞观基图极盛隆，谁将神器付昏童。\n倒持剑柄归房闼，仙李枝柯一剪空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17393,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"明皇","author":"王十朋","text":"天宝君臣玩太平，梨园弟于奏新声。\n贵妃一笑天颜喜，不觉胡尘暗两京。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17394,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"肃宗","author":"王十朋","text":"张后宫中巧弄权，上皇西内老谁怜。\n杜陵独念君臣义，长向云安拜杜鹃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17395,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"德宗","author":"王十朋","text":"虏箭侵陵御幄时，君臣相顾不胜悲。\n难平犹自推天命，卢杞奸邪竟不知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17396,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宪宗","author":"王十朋","text":"叛将连头就典刑，元和功业竟无成。\n晚年误信妖人术，祸自丹砂药里生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17397,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"文宗","author":"王十朋","text":"辇路青青春草多，凭高无语涕滂沱。\n禁中夜召词臣语，受制家奴可奈何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17398,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梁太祖","author":"王十朋","text":"天下人心共恶梁，祇应无奈虎狼彊。\n可怜千尺黄河水，投尽清流始灭唐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17399,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"唐庄宗","author":"王十朋","text":"十年征战不知劳，三矢功成意气豪。\n自咤身为李天下，焉知祸起郭门高。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17400,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晋高祖","author":"王十朋","text":"玉帛和蕃辱已深，那堪割地侈戎心。\n关南一陷腥膻后，遗患寥寥直至今。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17401,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"汉高祖","author":"王十朋","text":"石氏君臣尽播迁，晋阳兵起据中原。\n早知只有三年汉，何似捐躯报晋恩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17402,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"周太祖","author":"王十朋","text":"出镇雄藩势已危，拥兵乘衅袭京师。\n谁知一代生灵主，元是雕青郭雀儿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17403,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}}]